### Login
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dispatcher@cad.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Create Incident
POST http://localhost:3333/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "priority": 2,
  "type": "Robbery",
  "address": "Mission Row PD",
  "narrative": "Caller reports robbery in progress",
  "locationLat": 34.0522,
  "locationLng": -118.2437
}

### Approve Citizen Vehicle
POST http://localhost:3333/api/citizen/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisor_token}}

{
  "status": "APPROVED"
}

### Submit BOLO
POST http://localhost:3333/api/bolos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dispatcher_token}}

{
  "category": "VEHICLE",
  "subjectRef": "LS1005",
  "description": "Black four-door sedan fleeing last robbery",
  "expiresAt": "2024-12-31T05:00:00.000Z"
}
